Package: sasonr
Title: Run SAS Programs on an R Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Kaiping", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kaiping.yang@example.com")
Description: Deterministically parses SAS programs into a faithful abstract
    syntax tree and compiles DATA steps into tidyverse R code. Unsupported
    language features fail loudly with classed conditions.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    cli,
    DBI,
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    duckdb,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    vctrs
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
